# svc-repel: the Repel keeps weaker wild Pokémon away (decomp
# Field_CheckWildEncounter → the Repel check: a wild Pokémon below the lead's level does not appear). The
# lead is level 20 on Route 201 (levels 2–4); the Repel's steps are set (the bag's Repel sets them in
# svc-bag). Walking back and forth in the grass counts them down and starts no battle. Without the Repel
# the same walk meets wild Pokémon on seeds 1–3 (tests/integration/services-m3a.rom.test.ts runs it).
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_TURTWIG 20
set state repel 100
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_201 115 853 right
until idle
# wild encounters (only without the Repel) flee at once, so both runs walk the same path
+1 wild flee
+1 press right
until position 119 853
+0 release right
until idle
+1 press left
until position 115 853
+0 release left
until idle
+1 press right
until position 119 853
+0 release right
until idle
+1 press left
until position 115 853
+0 release left
until idle
+1 press right
until position 119 853
+0 release right
until idle
+1 press left
until position 115 853
+0 release left
until idle
+1 press right
until position 119 853
+0 release right
until idle
+1 press left
until position 115 853
+0 release left
until idle
+0 assert battles wild 0
+0 assert state repel 68
